# Lines spoken by the heretic figurine when squeezed.

figurines-heretic-1 = The Mansus watches, and it is patient.
figurines-heretic-2 = Ash remembers every name it has burned.
figurines-heretic-3 = Flesh is only a door. Someone has to open it.
figurines-heretic-4 = Do you hear the knocking? It is not at your door.
figurines-heretic-5 = The blade knows the way home.
figurines-heretic-6 = Rust is just iron admitting the truth.
figurines-heretic-7 = Void takes nothing. It only keeps.
figurines-heretic-8 = I walked the path, and the path walked back.
figurines-heretic-9 = Every eye that opens closes another.
figurines-heretic-10 = Reality is a rumour. I have better sources.
figurines-heretic-11 = Come closer. The sacrifice is nearly ready.
